{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2512","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2512/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2512/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2512/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2512","id":4417923903,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc8AAAABB1QrPw","number":2512,"title":"Bug: MCP tools/list fails with JSON Schema $defs references (Google Stitch MCP)","user":{"login":"JASP15","id":114491211,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtL_Sw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114491211?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JASP15","html_url":"https://github.com/JASP15","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JASP15/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JASP15/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JASP15/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JASP15/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JASP15/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JASP15/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JASP15/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JASP15/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JASP15/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-05-11T03:44:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T20:57:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"\n### Environment\n\n* Trae version: 3.5.55\n\n<img width=\"675\" height=\"124\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce2bd2fa-c232-44e4-8539-e55c93391b83\" />\n\n<img width=\"675\" height=\"124\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/26941f70-02a9-441c-b07d-54102a9e3f66\" />\n\n* OS: macOS\n* MCP transport: stdio via supergateway\n* Remote MCP: Google Stitch (`https://stitch.googleapis.com/mcp`)\n\n### Description\n\nTrae successfully connects to the remote MCP server and completes handshake, but fails during `tools/list`.\n\nThe issue appears related to JSON Schema reference resolution (`$defs` / `$ref`) returned by the MCP server.\n\n### Error\n\n```txt\ncan't resolve reference #/$defs/ScreenInstance\n```\n\n### Logs\n\n```txt\nListing tools\ncan't resolve reference #/$defs/ScreenInstance\n```\n\n### What was tested\n\n* Direct remote MCP\n* supergateway bridge\n* stdio transport\n* streamableHttp transport\n* authentication works correctly\n* MCP endpoint responds correctly\n\nThe issue consistently occurs during schema parsing after `tools/list`.\n\n### Related upstream issues\n\n* https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/26529\n* https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/pull/26614\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nTrae should correctly resolve or sanitize JSON Schema references returned by MCP tools.\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nTrae fails to parse schemas containing `$defs` references and aborts MCP tool loading.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2512/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2512/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4608810686","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2512#issuecom